The '''[[2023–24 in Scottish football|2023–24 season]]''' was [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]]'s 130th season of competitive football.

==Pre-season and friendlies==
Celtic held a pre-season training camp in Portugal before travelling to Japan, where they played friendlies against [[Yokohama F. Marinos]] and [[Gamba Osaka]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/may/02/celtic-are-heading-to-japan-this-summer/ | title=Celtic heading to Japan this summer | publisher=Celtic FC | date=2 May 2023 | access-date=8 May 2023}}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/may/09/celtic-to-play-yokohama-f--marinos-/ | title=Celtic to play Yokohama F. Marinos on Japan tour | publisher=Celtic FC | date=9 May 2023 | access-date=9 May 2023}}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/may/25/celtic-to-play-gamba-osaka-on-japan-tour/ | title=Celtic to play Gamba Osaka on Japan tour | publisher=Celtic FC | date=25 May 2023 | access-date=25 May 2023}}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/july/25/review-of-celtic-s-tour-of-japan/ | title=Review of Celtic's tour of Japan | publisher=Celtic FC | date=25 July 2023 | access-date=27 July 2023}}</ref> On their return from Japan, they faced [[Wolverhampton Wanderers F.C.|Wolverhampton Wanderers]] in [[Dublin]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/july/12/celtic-heading-to-dublin-to-face-wolverhampton-wanderers-/ | title=Celtic heading to Dublin to face Wolverhampton Wanderers | publisher=Celtic FC | date=12 July 2023 | access-date=12 July 2023}}</ref> Their pre-season schedule concluded with [[James Forrest (footballer, born 1991)|James Forrest]]'s testimonial match, in which [[Athletic Bilbao]] visited Celtic Park.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/may/25/charities-to-benefit-as-athletic-club-honour-james-forrest-in-fantastic-testimonial-match/ | title=Charities to benefit as Athletic Club honour James Forrest in fantastic testimonial match | publisher=Celtic FC | date=25 May 2023 | access-date=25 May 2023}}</ref>

