==Scottish Premiership==
{{Main|2023–24 Scottish Premiership}}
The Premiership fixture list was announced on 30 June 2023.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/june/30/celtic-kick-off-title-defence-at-home-against/ | title=Celtic kick-off title defence at home against Ross County | publisher=Celtic FC | date=30 June 2023 | access-date=30 June 2023}}</ref> Celtic began their title defence against Ross County at Celtic Park.

