==Scottish Cup==
{{Main|2023–24 Scottish Cup}}
On 26 November, Celtic were drawn to face [[Buckie Thistle F.C.|Buckie Thistle]] at Celtic Park in the fourth round of the [[2023–24 Scottish Cup]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/november/26/celts-come-out-of-the-hat-with-buckie-thistle-in-scottish-cup/ | title=Celts come out of the hat with Buckie Thistle in Scottish Cup | publisher=Celtic FC | date=26 November 2023 | access-date=26 November 2023}}</ref> On 21 January 2024, Celtic were drawn to face [[St Mirren F.C.|St Mirren]] at [[St Mirren Park]] in the fifth round.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/january/21/celtic-face-trip-to-st-mirren-in-scottish-cup-fifth-round/ | title=Celtic face trip to St Mirren in Scottish Cup fifth round | publisher=Celtic FC | date=21 January 2024 | access-date=21 January 2024}}</ref> On 11 February, Celtic were drawn to face [[Livingston F.C.|Livingston]] at Celtic Park in the quarter-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/february/11/celtic-to-host-livingston-in-scottish-cup-quarter-final/ | title=Celtic to host Livingston in Scottish Cup quarter-final | publisher=Celtic FC | date=11 February 2024 | access-date=11 February 2024}}</ref> On 11 March, Celtic were drawn to face [[Aberdeen F.C.|Aberdeen]] in the semi-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2024/march/11/celtic-to-play-aberdeen-in-scottish-cup-semi-final/ | title=Celtic to play Aberdeen in Scottish Cup semi-final | publisher=Celtic FC | date=11 March 2024 | access-date=11 March 2024}}</ref> Celtic faced [[Rangers F.C.|Rangers]] in the final on 25 May.

