==UEFA Champions League==
{{Main|2023–24 UEFA Champions League}}
Celtic entered the UEFA Champions League at the [[2023–24 UEFA Champions League group stage|group stage]].

===Group stage===
{{main|2023–24 UEFA Champions League group stage#Group E}}
On 31 August, the draw for the group stage was made. Celtic were drawn in Group E along with [[Feyenoord]], [[Atlético Madrid]] and [[SS Lazio|Lazio]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/august/31/celtic-to-face-lazio--atletico-madrid-and-feyenoord-in-uefa-champions-league/ | title=Celtic to face Lazio, Atletico Madrid and Feyenoord in UEFA Champions League | publisher=Celtic FC | date=31 August 2023 | access-date=31 August 2023}}</ref>

