===Kit===
'''Supplier:''' [[Adidas]] / '''Sponsors:''' [[Dafabet]] (front) and [[Magners]] (back)

The club will be in the fourth year of a deal with [[Adidas]] – the club's official kit supplier.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/17678 | title=Celtic announce magnificent new five-year partnership with adidas | publisher=Celtic FC | date=13 March 2020 | access-date=25 May 2020}}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/18279 | title=Celtic welcomes adidas | publisher=Celtic FC | date=1 July 2020 | access-date=1 July 2020}}</ref>

