*'''Home:''' The home kit features the traditional green and white hoops with a black trim, and a modern pattern inspired by the stained-glass window from the original entrance to Celtic Park. White shorts and patterned socks complete the look.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/june/30/adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2023-24-home-kit---pre-order-now/ | title=adidas x Celtic FC reveal 2023/24 Home Kit: Pre-order now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=30 June 2023 | access-date=30 June 2023}}</ref>
*'''Away:''' The away kit features a black shirt with a green trim, and celebrates the club's Scottish heritage with intricate details on the collar and sleeve cuffs. The shirt is accompanied by black shorts and socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/june/14/adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2023-24-away-kit---pre-order-now/ | title=adidas x Celtic FC reveal 2023/24 Away Kit: Pre-order now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=14 June 2023 | access-date=19 June 2023}}</ref>
*'''Third:''' The third kit features a dark green shirt with light green details, and a sound wave design inspired by Glasgow's music scene. The shirt is accompanied by matching shorts and socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/august/01/adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2023-24-third-kit--pre-order-now/ | title=adidas x Celtic FC reveal 2023/24 Third Kit: On sale now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=1 August 2023 | access-date=19 August 2023}}</ref>

